Probably the best WW2 RTS with incredible detail & non-boring simulation:
Pick guns, manage inventory of every soldier, give Your medic a machine gun or change his helmet, roast enemy tank with molotov cocktails, refill empty fuel tank of Your tank, complete mission with single soldier...
If there's a thing You would like to do in war simulation - You probably can do it in this game.

Ever wanted to feel what it's like to knock out an enemy tank, repair & re-crew it using Your infantry and use that same tank against enemy - this is the game.

My favorite time-killer sandbox style:
1. Choose campaign;
2. Set up Your defences;
3. Smash enemy reinforcements;
4. Scavenge what's left;
5. Finish mission;
6. Go to the next one.

